- **You may not** use the **game, its assets, or its branding** in **commercial** ways (including selling, sublicensing for money, or using as part of a paid product) **without prior written permission** from the rights holder.
- The game is provided **“as is”**, without warranty of any kind, express or implied, including but not limited to fitness for a particular purpose. See also Section 5.

## 2. Source code in this repository

- **You may** view, copy, and modify the **source code** in this repository for **non-commercial** purposes (e.g. personal learning, private study, and non-profit projects that do not generate revenue).
- **You may not** use the **source code** (including modified versions) for **commercial** purposes **without** prior **written** permission from the rights holder. That includes, without limitation, selling software, using it in paid services, or in products sold for profit.
- Redistributing **source** or **derivatives** of this code (even non-commercially) is allowed only if you keep these terms and do not suggest endorsement by Vardo Games; you must not remove or hide this license file.

## 3. Trademarks and brand

- The **name** “Vardo Games”, the **Vardo** trade name, and all **logos and marks** of Vardo Games (including those shown in the game and repository) are the **property of Vardo** (or its designated company) and are **not** licensed to you for use in your own products, services, or marketing **without** prior **written** permission, except for fair use (e.g. factually describing that your fork is “based on” this project) where applicable law allows.

## 4. Third-party components

- Components such as the **Godot Engine**, **.NET** runtime, and any libraries or media used under their own licenses **remain** under their **respective** licenses. Nothing in this file is intended to re-license third-party code.

## 5. Limitation of liability

- To the maximum extent permitted by law, the **rights holder** and contributors **are not** liable for any **damages** arising from use of the game or the source.

